  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Ethical Recruitment Practices and Implementation Capacity of Relevant Stakeholders in El Salvador, Guatemala, Honduras and Costa Rica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to contribute to strengthening the technical capacity of stakeholders involved in cross-border recruitment in Costa Rica, El Salvador, Honduras and Guatemala to improve regulation and implement ethical recruitment in a manner consistent with international standards and utilizing the outcomes of the Global Policy Network.</narrative>
  </description>
